notes.content:
Hello racers!
We are happy to bring you this new update for Neodori Forever.

Changes
This update brings changes made on mobile platforms and Neodori Infinity (The VR Quest version) to the Steam release.
Among those changes we have:

New car models for both Player and Rivals (Directly from Neodori Infinity);
New unlockable car skins (including the ones from the Rivals);
New and improved sound effects;
Shorten starting tunnel zone length: Get right into the action!
New Nitro boost behaviour: The gauge will deplete in defined steps and the boost can only be activated if you have enough Nitro available;
Improved Camera: Dynamic field of view during a boost and slightly changed its position;
Added corner Auto-Drift: You can enable this in the settings (it's disabled by default);
Added Touch Screen support;
Various other bug fixes and changes to improve the game experience.


Native Linux Support
This game was already playable on Steam Decks and Linux devices through Proton but now we have added full native support for Linux platforms!
The game is now officially supported on all three platforms available on Steam.

Enjoy!
